        <mxCell id="v-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A&quot;&gt;01. 전체 시스템 아키텍처&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#475569;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;Slack 질문이 동기 접수 경계를 지나 비동기 RAG 처리·Thread 답변·로컬 관측으로 이어지는 전체 지도&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="42" y="22" width="1716" height="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="user" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#611F69;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;USER UI&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;Slack 사용자&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;PC/Web 앱에서 Bot을 멘션하고&lt;br&gt;같은 Thread에서 답변 확인&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="190" width="185" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="operator" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0F766E;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;DEVELOPER / TESTER&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;개발자·검증자&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;문서 적재 · 평가 · 검토 · 복구&lt;br&gt;Grafana에서 로컬 지표·로그 확인&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="520" width="185" height="135" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="slack" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#611F69;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;SLACK CLOUD&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;Events API / Web API&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;app_mention 전달&lt;br&gt;chat.postMessage Thread 답변&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C4A5C8;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="345" y="180" width="190" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tunnel" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#C2410C;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;DEV-ONLY TRANSPORT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;Cloudflare Quick Tunnel&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;공개 HTTPS 요청을 로컬 :8000으로 전달&lt;br&gt;영구 인프라가 아닌 실제 E2E 개발 경로&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FDBA74;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="345" y="355" width="190" height="135" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="localapi" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0F766E;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;FASTAPI ROUTES&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;관리·검토 Endpoint&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;Job 조회 · Review 처리 · 수동 복구&lt;br&gt;Webhook과 같은 API 프로세스 내부&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="345" y="610" width="190" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="api" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#2563EB;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;FASTAPI · UVICORN&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;Webhook/API 프로세스&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;원문 서명·Timestamp 검증&lt;br&gt;Pydantic 계약 검증 · 빠른 2xx ACK&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="630" y="180" width="235" height="135" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="outbox" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#7C3AED;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;OUTBOX PROCESS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;Job Outbox Publisher&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;DB Outbox 임대 선점&lt;br&gt;Publisher Confirm 후 SENT 전이&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="630" y="410" width="235" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="consumer" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#7C3AED;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;WORKER PROCESS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;RabbitMQ Consumer&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;멱등 선점 · 최소 한 번 전달 대응&lt;br&gt;결과 저장 뒤 ACK&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="915" y="410" width="235" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="workflow" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0F766E;letter-spacing:0.4px&quot;&gt;LANGGRAPH&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;RAG Workflow&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#475569;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px&quot;&gt;의도·위험 분류 → 검색·등급화&lt;br&gt;답변 생성·인용 검증 또는 사람 검토&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
